{# ── HOW WE SOURCE ────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="sourcing-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="section-header__eyebrow">How We Work</p>
      <h2 class="section-header__title" id="sourcing-heading">The GHLS sourcing model</h2>
      <p class="section-header__sub">
        Four principles that define every procurement decision we make on behalf of our clinic partners.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-principles">

      <div class="about-principle">
        <div class="about-principle__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="about-principle__body">
          <h3 class="about-principle__title">Compliance first, always</h3>
          <p class="about-principle__desc">Every product we carry is FDA-cleared and meets all applicable CLIA and state-level clinical standards. We do not source outside regulated channels — ever. Savings that create compliance risk aren't savings at all.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-principle">
        <div class="about-principle__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="about-principle__body">
          <h3 class="about-principle__title">Active market procurement</h3>
          <p class="about-principle__desc">We don't passively reorder from a single supplier. Our procurement team actively monitors the market for supply opportunities — excess inventory, favorable contract windows, direct manufacturer relationships — and uses every one of them to reduce your cost.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-principle">
        <div class="about-principle__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 7V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="about-principle__body">
          <h3 class="about-principle__title">Full documentation, every order</h3>
          <p class="about-principle__desc">Lot numbers, expiration dates, and chain of custody are included on every shipment. Your compliance team gets everything they need without having to ask for it. Documentation is part of the service, not an afterthought.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-principle">
        <div class="about-principle__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="about-principle__body">
          <h3 class="about-principle__title">One contact, real relationship</h3>
          <p class="about-principle__desc">You'll work with a dedicated rep — not a call center, not a ticketing system. Someone who knows your clinic, your volume, your preferences, and your history. That's how we catch issues before they become problems and anticipate what you need before you have to ask.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── WHAT MAKES US DIFFERENT ──────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="different-heading">
  <div class="container about-diff-grid">

    <div class="section-header section-header--left">
      <p class="section-header__eyebrow">Why GHLS</p>
      <h2 class="section-header__title" id="different-heading">We're not a general distributor who added a product line.<br />We're specialists.</h2>
      <p class="section-header__sub">
        The difference matters more than it sounds. General distributors spread their buying power across thousands of SKUs. We concentrate ours in two categories — which means stronger supplier leverage, faster restocking, and better prices specifically on the products your clinic orders every single week.
      </p>
      <a href="{{ '/products/' | url }}" class="btn btn--primary" style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">Browse Our Products</a>
    </div>

    <div class="about-diff-list">
      <div class="about-diff-item">
        <div class="about-diff-item__header">
          <span class="about-diff-item__label about-diff-item__label--bad">General Distributor</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="advantage-list" role="list">
          <li class="advantage-list__item">Thousands of SKUs, diluted buying power</li>
          <li class="advantage-list__item">Markups that cover enterprise overhead</li>
          <li class="advantage-list__item">Call center support, high turnover reps</li>
          <li class="advantage-list__item">Rigid minimum orders built for their warehouse</li>
          <li class="advantage-list__item">Documentation provided only when you ask</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="about-diff-item about-diff-item--ghls">
        <div class="about-diff-item__header">
          <span class="about-diff-item__label about-diff-item__label--good">GHLS Inc.</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="advantage-list" role="list">
          <li class="advantage-list__item">Two categories, maximum purchasing leverage</li>
          <li class="advantage-list__item">Savings passed directly to you</li>
          <li class="advantage-list__item">Dedicated rep who knows your account</li>
          <li class="advantage-list__item">Flexible quantities that match your actual usage</li>
          <li class="advantage-list__item">Full documentation included on every order</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

